            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.7.17+EXO.7.18+EXO.7.19+EXO.7.20+EXO.7.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 7:17-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.78.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 78:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo malaika mar'adek oolo atawo pere i jwombe kodi i waŋ pi, to jolokere remo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awinjo malaika ma kuro pi waco ni, “Banja me ithumo m'otire, a Ŋataleŋ, manitie pama kendo m'otieko bedo wok con. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rupiri jooyo remo pa ji maleŋ kodi apa jotuci wac Were, imiyo jo madho remo, meno ripo gi jo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo awinjo dwondi moro wok kwoŋ migam munyo waco ni, “Rwoth, Were Majameni je! Thumo banja perin otire odoko obedo mar'adieri!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo malaika mar'aŋwen oolo atawo pere kwoŋ waŋceŋ, t'iyeyo waŋceŋ rewo piny gi lietho mere pa mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji jowaŋ gi lietho mager no, to jokwoŋo nyingi Were manitie gi meni kwoŋ thoyamo me je, to jokwero ŋuto kwoŋ reco pajo kosa miyo Were dwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.10.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 10:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo malaika mar'abic oolo atawo pere wi kom p'ogwaŋ ma dhum, to mudho umo ker pere, ji jokayo lew jo ro litho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to jokwoŋo Were ma polo ro litho kodi adholin pajo, to jok'oŋuto tim pajo mareco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
