        {
          "text": "Kenyo pilin, derino, mwoc pa lithkoth, kodi yengirok pa piny m'oasere otimere ma fodi yado onwaŋo k'otimere ye ameno wok cuka cwey dhano. Me obedo yengirok pa piny marac m'oasere! ",
