        },
        {
          "text": "Tindi m'ombo ca okedhere didek, aka tindin ma piny je oŋinyere woko. Were opoyo Babilon madwoŋ no, to miyo go medho iy'agwata m'opoŋ gi vini ma keme pere je. ",
